{
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "meeting_at_a_glance",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Sam Reyes, Priya Nair, Marcus Ellery, and Ingrid Solheim are meeting to conduct a checkpoint on the merchant onboarding redesign, covering the timeline, risk workstream, and regulator deadline.",
          "citations": [
            "cal:M1"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "client_snapshot",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Halden Pay is engaged for a merchant onboarding redesign project with a total fixed professional fee of £62,000.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The fee is payable in three instalments: £22,000 upon project commencement, £20,000 upon delivery of the risk-scoring review, and £20,000 upon completion of the portal requirements documentation.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The project scope includes an audit of the merchant application journey, evaluation of automated risk-scoring logic, and defining requirements for the updated merchant portal.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The target go-live date for the new onboarding flow is 14 April 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D4",
            "email:E47"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A deadline of 31 March 2026 has been set for the Payments Oversight Authority safeguarding attestation.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E49"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The total change-request budget for the remainder of the project phase is capped at £15,000.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D19"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Internal data from 10 December 2025 indicated that 31% of prospective merchants drop out during the initial application process.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The chargeback rate fell from 0.92% to 0.61% following a rules engine update at the start of the quarter.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D9"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "recent_news",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "On 29 January 2026, it was reported that Halden Pay's total processed volume for 2025 was €4.1bn, a 22% increase over the prior year.",
          "citations": [
            "news:N9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 24 February 2026, Halden Pay officially introduced instant payout capabilities for its merchant network in Ireland.",
          "citations": [
            "news:N22"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "where_we_left_off",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "On 5 February 2026, Ingrid Solheim informed the team that VeriTrace was chosen as the KYC vendor because it verifies merchants 38% faster than IdentiQ.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E37"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 25 February 2026, the steering committee formally decided to pause the Spanish expansion until Q3 and approved initial wireframes for the automated verification module.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D19"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 27 February 2026, Priya Nair sent an invoice for the second instalment of £20,000 with 30-day payment terms.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E55"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 4 March 2026, Sam Reyes requested an ETA for the risk-scoring matrix from Ingrid Solheim.",
          "citations": [
            "chat:C25"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 6 March 2026, Ingrid Solheim stated she had not yet sent the matrix due to audit prep and would try to get to it later but made no promises.",
          "citations": [
            "chat:C28"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 6 March 2026, Priya Nair emphasized that formal sign-off on the attestation is required before moving to the next phase.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E66"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "open_items",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Ingrid Solheim promised on 18 February 2026 to deliver the updated KYC risk-scoring matrix by Friday 27 February 2026, but stated on 6 March 2026 she had not yet sent it.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E46",
            "chat:C28"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 25 February 2026, the project manager was tasked with prioritising the backlog to ensure improvements stay within the £15,000 change-request budget.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D19"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Northwind Advisory committed on 25 February 2026 to investigating alternative integration methods for the KYC service to mitigate latency issues before the beta launch.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D19"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Payments Oversight Authority safeguarding attestation deadline is 31 March 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E49"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The board expects the new merchant onboarding flow to go live on 14 April 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E47"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "attendees",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Sam Reyes is a Senior Consultant at Northwind Advisory and serves as the day-to-day lead on all three engagements.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Priya Nair is an Engagement Manager at Northwind Advisory who leads the Halden Pay engagement and owns contracts and invoicing.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Marcus Ellery is the Chief Financial Officer at Halden Pay and the budget owner who requires fixed dates and capped costs.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ingrid Solheim is the Head of Risk at Halden Pay, responsible for KYC and risk scoring, and is currently stretched thin by audit preparation.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P6",
            "chat:C28"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "talking_points_and_risks",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "The updated KYC risk-scoring matrix is overdue from the 27 February 2026 promised date, which is delaying the review required for the second £20,000 payment instalment.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E46",
            "chat:C28",
            "doc:D4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Marcus Ellery has stated there is no room for movement on the 14 April 2026 go-live timeline or the 31 March 2026 safeguarding attestation deadline.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E47",
            "email:E49"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Friction points identified in the multi-factor authentication flow require further iteration to meet the target go-live date.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D15"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Formal sign-off on the safeguarding attestation must be secured before the project can move to the next phase.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E66"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All change requests must be prioritised within the £15,000 budget cap and require written approval from the CFO.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D19",
            "doc:D4"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
